Scope

The MIT License above covers the source code in this repository: the JavaScript,
HTML, CSS and Python written for it.

It does not cover:

- the Sony 80th-anniversary illustration and everything cut or derived from it:
  reference image/cassette.png, reference image/illustrations/, render/tex/ and
  the textures in render/*.png;
- the renders, GIFs, preview images and 3D files made with it (output/), or the
  artwork embedded in the built pages (index.html, output/*.html);
- the Sony name and logo (render/brand/sony.svg), and the names Walkman,
  Trinitron, Cyber-shot and the product names, which are trademarks of Sony Group
  Corporation or its affiliates;
- the Hikaru logo (render/brand/hikaru.png), which belongs to Hikaru Digital
  Marketing.

The illustration is used here with permission and may not be reused without
permission from its owner.

The built pages bundle three.js (MIT License, Copyright 2010-2024 three.js
authors); its notice is kept at the top of the bundled code.
